      "keysecondary": [],
      "comment": "The parcel film",
      "content": "Sora is developing a fictional silent comedy about two couriers who exchange a hat box and a cake box. She has mapped the opening chase but not its ending. The humour should come from timing and misunderstandings, not injury. A partner can suggest a gag or choose a different subject. This project is not a finished movie, and mentioning a storyboard does not mean a file has been rendered.",
