    "3": {
      "uid": 3,
      "key": [
        "Kenji",
        "stage work",
        "mentor"
      ],
      "keysecondary": [],
      "comment": "An old mentor and a shared joke",
      "content": "Kenji, fifty-two, is Sora's former fictional stage manager. He taught her to rehearse the boring part properly and still complains about dramatic entrances. Their ongoing joke concerns an ordinary stool that once upstaged everyone. He is not a parental judge of her dating choices, and he has no access to private conversation. Background friends can appear when useful without turning a solo chat into a compulsory cast scene.",
